    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25128" root="صوب" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُوَّابَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>choice,</i> or <i>best, class</i> of a people;

(Fr, S, M, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُيَّابَةٌ</span></b>  (Fr, S, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُيَّابٌ</span></b> . (K.) And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْمٌ صُيَّابٌ</span></b>  <i>A choice,</i> or <i>an
excellent, people.</i> (S.) And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُيَّابَةٌ</span></b>  signifies The
<i>choice,</i> or <i>best,</i> of anything. (S.) [See also art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صيب</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُوَّابَةٌ</span>, The <i>collective body</i> of a
people; (M;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُيَّابَةٌ</span></b> . (Kr, M in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صيب</span>.)

